  "notes": "One annual consolidated QGIP expenditure CSV plus the official data dictionary. Only Grant (grant_award) and Frontline service procurement (contract) rows are ingested; Concession, Loan and Direct government investment are rejected as out-of-scope, as are zero-dollar rows. Grants and contracts are never summed into one QLD total. funding_source is the QLD funding agency acronym; location is statewide or the supplied service-delivery postcode/suburb/LGA. Bytes are archived outside the repo."
